# Synthetic demo code for Nexus Intelligence. Not a real system.
# ORB-WAF-1187 credential-stuffing detection. mode=simulate (log-only).
# Simulate still executes the expression. The nested .* (?:.*=.*) backtracks
# inside re_backtrack_match and blows the 30000ms WAF eval budget.
(?:(?:\"|'|\]|\}|\\|\d|(?:nan|infinity|true|false|null))+[)]*;?((?:\s|-|~|!|{}|\|\||\+)*.*(?:.*=.*)))
